ss=\"bb_paragraph\">We simply process the things that come our way, one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What was the world <i>supposed</i> to be like?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t know. Time passes without knowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Someday, let\u2019s talk about the &quot;light&quot; that lies beyond resignation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627340/extras/SAYONALAIKA_store_616x158_002.png?t=1744873648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A walking simulator where various events unfold as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quest markers or time limits\u2014enjoy a relaxed gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t know the names of the stars, yet I still gazed at the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 10\u201325 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming is allowed without prior permission, both for individuals and businesses.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627340/74337e229a6fe160533f16bf38956b9ac18a4370/header.jpg?t=1744873648","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125147,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125147/movie480.mp4?t=1744422338","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125147/movie_max.mp4?t=1744422338"},"name":"SAYONALAIKA_pv002_720","thu